# AutonoM3 Agent Builder - Project Analysis

## Project Overview

AutonoM3 Agent Builder is an advanced web automation platform that combines the power of Playwright for browser automation with OpenAI's language models to create, manage, and execute web automation scripts through natural language instructions. The system provides an interactive environment where users can describe tasks in plain English, and the AI generates executable Playwright scripts that automate browser interactions.

## Project Purpose

The primary goal of AutonoM3 is to democratize web automation by eliminating the technical barriers traditionally associated with writing automation scripts. By leveraging natural language processing and a visual execution environment, the system enables:

1. Non-technical users to create complex web automation workflows
2. Technical users to rapidly prototype and test automation scripts
3. Organizations to standardize and share automation assets
4. Human-in-the-loop automation where complete automation isn't possible

